.TH "env:mode" 1 "August 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
env:mode \- Switch environment error reporting mode between dev (Ignition errors) and prod (500 pages)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php env:mode
.SH DESCRIPTION
Switch environment error reporting mode between dev (Ignition errors) and prod (500 pages)
